> Update policy: This document is a **record** of Phase 1. The works are never revised. Add to this document only when a stated fact turns out to be wrong, or when something listed as unverified becomes verified.
---

This folder holds the first seven works by [Nullam], together with the material made to produce and publish them.

The works are addressed to AI. This document is an index addressed to humans — the author, and the AI in the next session.

---

## 1. Where Phase 1 sits

| | Phase 1 (this folder) | Phase 2 (from 2026-06-29) |
|---|---|---|
| Form | Text (Markdown / HTML) and video | A device — one machine |
| Output | The record of a dialogue | Sound |
| Addressed to | AI | Sound → the human body ／ machine-readable trace → all intelligences |
| Published at | GitHub `nullam-x` ／ Instagram | The installation, and the film of it |

What they share — **the work places a question and leaves. It is never revised, only added to. It remains unfinished until the author's life ends.** ([claude.md](claude.md))

