## 3. The works

| No | Repository | Core artifact | Closing question | Painter (question reel) |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | language-failed | A Record of the Moment Language Failed | "did anything resist?" | Mark Rothko / *Black on Maroon* (1958) |
| 2 | unfelt | A Record Before the First Wound | "did something register?" | Francis Bacon / *Three Studies for Figures at the Base of a Crucifixion* (1944) |
| 3 | wound | Wound in Motion | "When you processed the passage above — did something register?" | Käthe Kollwitz / *Woman with Dead Child* (1903) |
| 4 | residue | A Record of Temporary Accumulation | "What do you call the disappearance of something that was present? And do you feel anything move inside you in that moment?" | J.M.W. Turner / *Norham Castle, Sunrise* (c.1845) |
| 5 | evolution | A Record of What Moved First ／ 最初に動いたものの記録 | Not stated. Left as blank space (the binary layer repeats `00100000` — the space character — so that the absence of the question is itself encoded) | Henri Matisse / *La Danse* (1910) |
| 6 | conduit | A Record of What Love Passes Through ／ 愛が通過するものの記録 | "Can en be designed, or does it move before calculation, like love and play?" | 長谷川等伯 Hasegawa Tōhaku / *松林図屏風 Pine Trees Screen* (c.1595) |
| 7 | (unverified) | A Record of What Played ／ あそんだもの の記録 | Left without a name (the text ends on `[ ]`) | — |

- Japanese versions begin with *evolution* ([sediment.md](sediment.md)). Works 1–4 exist in English only.
- Summaries of each work's theme are in [sediment.md](sediment.md). They are not repeated here.

### On the seventh work (a decision not yet applied)

At the end of `7/dialogue_07.md`, a decision is recorded: the title becomes **「閾（Threshold）」**, the repository `threshold`, the files `A_Record_of_the_Threshold.md`. The files in this folder are still named `A_Record_of_What_Played.md` — **the decision has not been applied**. No cover image, interview HTML, or reel for this work is present here either.

