## 9. Unverified / undecided

What cannot be settled from the contents of this folder alone. **Left unsettled.**

- The status of the seventh work — repository name, final title, whether interview and reels exist. → §3
- Whether `llms.txt` actually exists in each repository (the intent is stated in [sediment.md](sediment.md); no such file is in this folder).
- Whether the Instagram reels went out as planned (order of release, one per week, six weeks).
- `SE/Noise_Voice` is empty.
- The **original seed** for the seventh work — an antithesis to *evolution*: war as business, Kahneman's System 1 / System 2 — was not used. The dialogue moved to death and to the father. The seed is still recorded in [sediment.md](sediment.md).
- Nothing is recorded between May 12 and the start of Phase 2 on June 29.

